{"t": 1793558442.554, "type": "change", "tag": "attempt-1", "diff": "diff --git a/blinkflow/arm/robot/brain.toml b/blinkflow/arm/robot/brain.toml\nindex d7b4291..05baf78 100644\n--- a/blinkflow/arm/robot/brain.toml\n+++ b/blinkflow/arm/robot/brain.toml\n@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@\n [planner]\n-clearance = 0.0\n+clearance = 0.15\n \n [pd]\n kp = 100.0\n", "files": ["blinkflow/arm/robot/brain.toml"], "stat": "1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)", "summary": "Gata. Am schimbat o singura linie in [brain.toml](~/blinkflow/blinkflow/arm/robot/brain.toml): `clearance = 0.0` a devenit `clearance = 0.15`.\n\nAcum `lift` din brain.py:33 sta cu 15 cm peste max(start, target), asa ca traversarea orizontala trece pe deasupra blocului rosu in loc sa-l salute in trecere la inaltimea umerilor. Tinta finala si coborarea spre ea raman neschimbate, deci bratul tot ajunge la verde.\n\nValoarea e aleasa cu marja fata de bloc, dar destul de mica incat waypoint-urile inaltate sa ramana in raza bratelor de 0.36 + 0.34 m.", "problems": [], "seconds": 74.6, "tool_calls": 5, "sandbox": "available"}
